      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how deeply hurt you feel by their words and how heavy the absence of that bond has made the daily routine feel pointless. Their suggestions feel dismissive because they cannot understand the profound grief of losing a specific, loving connection that gave your world warmth. It is okay to take all the pain you feel in silence and to let your support system know that \"just get a new one\" does not make sense when the one you hope is the only one that ever truly knew \"just the way I am.\"",
